          {
            "title": "Function",
            "id": 89381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare una list comprehension per creare una nuova lista applicando una funzione come <code>halve()</code> a ogni elemento di una lista esistente come <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Function 2",
            "id": 89382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione che useremo, <code>halve()</code>, accetta un numero <code>num</code> come argomento e ne restituisce la metà con <code>num/2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>num</code>, seguito da <code>num/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Definisci <code>halve()</code> affinché accetti un numero <code>num</code> e ne restituisca la metà.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num*2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2/num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num+2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>num</code>, seguito da <code>num/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Loop",
            "id": 89383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come prima, iniziamo iterando su ogni <code>price</code> nell'elenco originale <code>prices</code> con un ciclo <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"109\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>for price in prices</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Function as an expression",
            "id": 89384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo scegliere le operazioni da applicare a ogni valore di <code>price</code> in una funzione come <code>halve()</code> e usarla come espressione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>halve</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>price</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>halved</code> chiamando <code>halve()</code> su ogni <code>price</code> in <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"halved\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>halve</code>, seguito da <code>price</code>, <code>price</code> e infine <code>prices</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni sono utili quando vogliamo applicare più espressioni, come rimuovere la tassa prima di dimezzare il prezzo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, seguito da <code>no_tax/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni ti permettono di applicare più espressioni a ogni elemento di una lista.</p><p>In <code>halve()</code>, calcola prima l'85% del prezzo con <code>0.85 * num</code>, poi restituisci quel valore diviso per <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax = 0.85 + num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax*2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, seguito da <code>no_tax/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return statement",
            "id": 89671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare solo funzioni che hanno un'istruzione <code>return</code>, perché in realtà stiamo aggiungendo il valore restituito alla nuova lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function as an expression",
            "id": 89665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come usiamo una chiamata di funzione come espressione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamiamo la funzione con la variabile del ciclo come argomento, per applicarla a ogni elemento della lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiamiamo la funzione senza alcun argomento</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamiamo la funzione con la variabile del ciclo come argomento, per applicarla a ogni elemento della lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per applicare una funzione a ogni elemento di un elenco, chiamala usando come argomento la variabile del ciclo.</p><p>Quale comprehension chiama <code>halve()</code> su ogni valore in <code>prices</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[halve() for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[price for halve(price) in prices]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché dovremmo usare una funzione come espressione in una list comprehension?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per applicare più espressioni ai valori su cui stiamo iterando</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché le espressioni sono sempre funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per applicare più espressioni ai valori su cui stiamo iterando.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione usata come espressione può applicare più calcoli a ogni valore di una list comprehension.</p><p>In quale situazione è utile chiamare una funzione nell'espressione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ogni prezzo richiede diversi passaggi di calcolo prima di entrare nel nuovo elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'elenco esistente deve essere usato senza modificare alcun valore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo il primo valore deve essere copiato nel nuovo elenco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ogni prezzo richiede diversi passaggi di calcolo prima di entrare nel nuovo elenco.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return statement",
            "id": 89674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare questa funzione all'interno di una list comprehension?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, perché non restituisce un valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, possiamo usare qualsiasi funzione all'interno di una list comprehension</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, perché non restituisce un valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per inserire il nome completo calcolato in una nuova lista, la funzione deve restituirlo invece di limitarsi a stamparlo.</p><p>Quale riga deve sostituire <code>print(full)</code> per restituire il nome calcolato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return full</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"full\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"Claire\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return full</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function",
            "id": 89666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno della list comprehension, chiama la funzione <code>add_comma()</code> con la variabile del ciclo <code>name</code> come argomento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>add_comma</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>name</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>authors_update</code> chiamando <code>add_comma()</code> su ogni <code>name</code> in <code>authors</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"185\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"authors_update\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>add_comma</code>, seguito da <code>name</code>, <code>name</code> e infine <code>authors</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function 2",
            "id": 89667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno della funzione <code>add_comma()</code>, dividi il nome in una lista chiamata <code>parts</code> usando <code>split()</code>. Poi aggiungi una virgola tra l'indice <code>1</code> e l'indice <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>parts = name.split(\" \")</code>, seguito da <code>parts[1] + \", \" + parts[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>add_comma()</code>, dividi <code>name</code> sullo spazio in <code>parts</code>, quindi restituisci il cognome, una virgola e il nome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"130\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts = name.split(&quot;,&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts[0] + &quot;, &quot; + parts[1]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visi