          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno della funzione <code>passed()</code>, scrivi una riga di codice per aggiungere un bonus di 10 punti al punteggio, quindi restituisci il risultato del controllo che verifica se il punteggio con il bonus è superiore a <code>90</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"83\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"passed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(score)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  with_bonus = score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" with_bonus &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"passing_scores = [passed(score) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(passing_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>with_bonus = score + 10</code>, seguito da <code>return</code> e infine <code>with_bonus &gt; 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>passed()</code>, aggiungi <code>10</code> punti bonus al punteggio, quindi restituisci se il punteggio con bonus supera <code>90</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"83\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"passed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(score)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  with_bonus = score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" with_bonus &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"passing_scores = [passed(score) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(passing_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"with_bonus = score - 10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"with_bonus &gt; 93\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>with_bonus = score + 10</code>, seguito da <code>return</code> e infine <code>with_bonus &gt; 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
